## [0.1.0] - 2026-10-24

### Added

- The `mandrake` binary with setup, capture, link, proxy, watch, hex, bench, audit and doctor; the prompt-trim, fancy and tui-embed plugins; the core prompt and the example soul Rhizo (#1).
